OL,3,GNEWSAJersey jobs increase by 440 in a
OL,4,Ayear, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of jobs in Jersey increased
OL,7,Fby more than 400 in a year, according
OL,8,Fto new figures.
OL,10,FStatistics Jerseys' latest labour
OL,11,Fmarket report showed there were 65,790
OL,12,Fjobs on the island in June 2026 - an
OL,13,Fincrease of 440 compared with the
OL,14,Fprevious year. It said there were
OL,15,F55,740 jobs in the private sector and
OL,16,F10,050 jobs in the public sector.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
