OL,3,GNEWSAJersey jobs increase by 440 in a
OL,4,Ayear, data shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FStatisticians said the largest annual
OL,7,Fincrease in the private sector was in
OL,8,Fprivate education, health and other
OL,9,Fservices, which grew by 440. Financial
OL,10,Fand legal activities increased by 80
OL,11,Fjobs.
OL,13,FIt said the increases were offset by
OL,14,Fdecreases of 130 jobs in wholesale and
OL,15,Fretail and 50 jobs in hotels,
OL,16,Frestaurants and bars.
